{"enemy":{"slug":"lord_of_thunder","id":"enemy_1573_pyczog","name":"Lord of Thunder","index":"ZIN","rank":"Boss","sort":1445,"hidden":false,"icon":"/enemies-icons/Lord of Thunder.webp","flavour_text":"The Iju of the previous cycle, named for the thunder and lightning twisting around its form. Allegedly, it gathers countless Thunderbugs while it hunts. It can manipulate the electricity coursing over it to increase the strength of its leaps or enter a supercharged state.","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attack_position":"Melee and Ranged","damage_type":["Arts"],"abilities":[{"text":"Charging State","format":"title"},{"text":"[Charge Electricity] Charges in place, accumulating stacks of charge. Becomes supercharged at a certain number of charges.","format":"normal"},{"text":"[Thunderclap Roar] Stuns all other units in a large range.","format":"normal"},{"text":"[Lightning Leap] Charges up and leaps to the area with the most allied units, dealing area damage to allied units. Then charges up and leaps to the area covered by the fewest allied Attack Ranges and performs [Charge Electricity] 2 times.","format":"normal"},{"text":"[Thunderous Rampage] Charges up and locks on to an allied unit within a certain range, charging towards them (stopped by high ground), and dealing damage to allied units it passes through. Then, [Charge Electricity] twice.","format":"normal"},{"text":"[Homing Ball Lightning] Charges up and leaps to the area covered by the fewest allied Attack Ranges, then fires three lightning balls that deal Arts damage. Then performs [Charge Electricity] 2 times.","format":"normal"},{"text":"Supercharged State","format":"title"},{"text":"[Thunder Armor] Immune to Paralysis, and gains status resistance.","format":"normal"},{"text":"[Scatter Lightning] Returns to Charging State after taking a certain amount of damage, or when it enters a mountable state.","format":"normal"},{"text":"[Greater Thunderclap Roar] Stuns all other units in a large range, and temporarily 